WEBVTT

00:09.250 --> 00:11.690
My recommendation here is the danzu.

00:11.690 --> 00:14.870
It's the sweetest confection this shop has!

00:14.870 --> 00:17.360
Danzu?

00:18.040 --> 00:20.630
Don't do it, Ivy! It's dangerous!

00:20.630 --> 00:23.590
Just one bite is so sweet that it'll make 
your eyes roll back and you'll faint!

00:23.590 --> 00:27.310
It'll be just fine! 
I'm certain you'll like it.

00:29.330 --> 00:31.620
Have you decided on what to order?

00:32.180 --> 00:33.590
I'll have the danzu.

00:33.590 --> 00:34.770
I'll have the danzu, too.

00:34.770 --> 00:35.760
Danzu for me, too.

00:35.760 --> 00:39.430
Um... the danzu?

00:40.600 --> 00:41.530
And you, sir?

00:41.530 --> 00:43.630
Mister Hagg, he'll have the danzu, too.

00:43.630 --> 00:44.730
Hey!

00:44.730 --> 00:46.680
Right, five danzu, then.

00:47.900 --> 00:49.410
Hey, wait!

00:49.410 --> 00:51.540
I'm not gonna eat something <i>that</i> dangerous!

00:51.540 --> 00:54.660
It'll be fine! Lattrua, 
you love sweets, don't you?

00:54.660 --> 00:57.010
I may have a sweet tooth, 
but there are <i>limits</i>!

00:57.010 --> 00:58.910
Hagg! Cancel that order!

00:58.910 --> 01:02.250
Our danzu isn't the overly sweet kind.
 It's really good!

01:02.250 --> 01:04.440
It does hit you hard 
in the beginning, though.

01:04.440 --> 01:06.920
What kind of sweetness hits you hard?

01:10.260 --> 01:11.670
<i>I thought so.</i>

01:12.620 --> 01:14.760
<i>Mister Hagg is a bad person, too.</i>

01:22.400 --> 01:25.070
<i>All right. Our operation starts now!</i>

01:26.320 --> 01:30.460
<i>When I'm alone, I can breathe</i>

01:30.460 --> 01:34.620
<i>In a world with no one 
but me, I feel at ease</i>

01:35.280 --> 01:39.640
<i>But I think the truth is</i>

01:39.640 --> 01:45.620
<i>That I've been waiting for 
morning's light to break through</i>

01:43.120 --> 01:51.380
<b>The Weakest Tamer
Began a Journey
to Pick Up Trash</b>

01:43.280 --> 01:45.620
<i>(Where could it be?)</i>

01:45.620 --> 01:48.870
<i>Beyond the edges of a yet unknown map</i>

01:48.870 --> 01:53.130
<i>That's where I'll find a place 
where I can live</i>

01:51.380 --> 01:53.130
<i>(If it exists...)</i>

01:53.130 --> 01:55.140
<i>I'd like to go there</i>

01:55.140 --> 01:58.890
<i>And with trembling legs, 
I take a step forward</i>

01:58.890 --> 02:01.480
<i>I'm on a journey without end</i>

02:01.480 --> 02:03.790
<i>And even if I carry nothing with me</i>

02:03.790 --> 02:05.940
<i>I'll take everything I feel</i>

02:05.940 --> 02:07.900
<i>And pack it into my once empty bag</i>

02:07.900 --> 02:09.720
<i>I'll go as far as I need to</i>

02:09.720 --> 02:11.940
<i>On this journey to find myself</i>

02:11.940 --> 02:14.030
<i>And everything I'm given along the way</i>

02:14.030 --> 02:18.490
<i>Will slowly fill my heart to the brim</i>

02:28.360 --> 02:32.720
<i>Now, I'm not all alone anymore</i>

02:32.720 --> 02:37.640
<i>Because I've met new, dear friends</i>

02:37.640 --> 02:42.390
<i>(Maybe we can understand each other 
because we're alike. Isn't it strange?)</i>

02:42.390 --> 02:45.600
<i>Your bright laughter gives me courage</i>

02:45.600 --> 02:49.860
<i>(I feel like I'm wrapped up 
snugly by your warmth)</i>

02:49.860 --> 02:55.110
<i>From now on, let's stay 
together forever and ever</i>

02:56.030 --> 03:01.040
<b>Into Battle</b>

03:03.470 --> 03:05.860
We've finally made it to Mamaroko.

03:06.290 --> 03:08.700
I've been wanting to bring you two here.

03:08.700 --> 03:10.920
The sweets are really delicious, Ivy.

03:10.920 --> 03:14.210
R-Really? I'm looking forward to it.

03:14.210 --> 03:17.760
Though I wish our first order 
was more beginner-friendly.

03:17.760 --> 03:21.070
But why? Everyone has a first time.

03:21.070 --> 03:23.720
If you're a man, you should just go big!

03:24.160 --> 03:27.530
Well, I do like sweets, 
so it will probably be fine.

03:28.390 --> 03:30.300
Leaving that aside,

03:31.650 --> 03:35.440
there's a reason I invited you 
out today. The thing is...

03:36.960 --> 03:39.920
I want to ask Green Gale to 
undertake a confidential mission.

03:39.920 --> 03:41.660
A confidential mission?

03:41.660 --> 03:44.290
The request actually comes from the GM,

03:44.290 --> 03:46.750
but I can't handle it on my own.

03:46.750 --> 03:50.380
I'm telling you, Green Gale, 
because I trust you so much.

03:50.380 --> 03:52.920
Please don't let anyone 
else know about this.

03:56.170 --> 04:01.260
A special unit of watchmen and adventurers 
is being put together right now.

04:01.260 --> 04:03.490
They're about to set out for the forest.

04:03.490 --> 04:06.040
While they're gone, security 
in town will be shorthanded,

04:06.040 --> 04:07.390
so I'd like you to help me with policing.

04:07.390 --> 04:09.370
A special unit?

04:09.370 --> 04:12.440
Is that the job the GM was putting together?

04:12.440 --> 04:17.110
A unit so large that the town will be left 
wide open? What will they be fighting?

04:17.530 --> 04:22.450
Ogres and an ogre king have been 
spotted in a cave in the forest.

04:36.500 --> 04:40.510
But I thought that the suppression 
squad had eliminated the ogres.

04:40.510 --> 04:42.980
They found some that got away.

04:42.980 --> 04:46.610
The plan is to launch an all-out attack 
while they're still all in one place.

04:47.150 --> 04:50.020
That's why they're putting 
the special unit together.

04:50.020 --> 04:54.950
While the special unit is deployed to the forest, 
the town will be vulnerable.

04:54.950 --> 04:57.580
It'll be bad if the organization 
attacks during that time.

04:58.840 --> 05:04.300
You see, they've even taken watchmen from 
the guard for the organization's former base.

05:04.300 --> 05:08.140
If that place were to be attacked now, 
there'd be nothing we can do.

05:08.150 --> 05:09.960
Here we are. Five orders of danzu.

05:09.960 --> 05:11.220
Thanks for waiting.

05:22.180 --> 05:24.090
Well, enjoy.

05:27.440 --> 05:32.730
Given all of that, I'd like for Green Gale 
to help with the town's security.

05:32.730 --> 05:35.860
I see. Well, if that's the case, 
then leave it to us!

05:35.860 --> 05:40.990
Yeah! If we're on patrol, then 
no one's gonna try anything bad!

05:46.830 --> 05:50.360
Mister Hagg heard what we said and left.

05:50.360 --> 05:51.750
I thought so.

05:52.290 --> 05:55.490
That's the first stage successfully completed.

05:56.210 --> 05:58.370
What? What are you talking about?

05:58.370 --> 06:00.190
Oh, it's just between us.

06:00.670 --> 06:02.450
Now, then...

06:03.210 --> 06:06.040
I have something incredibly 
important to discuss.

06:06.570 --> 06:11.390
So... why are you helping the organization?

06:12.410 --> 06:15.330
How much will you get for abducting Ivy?

06:15.330 --> 06:17.690
Do you really want money that badly?

06:17.690 --> 06:21.030
Wh-Whatever are you talking about?

06:25.070 --> 06:26.140
Eat it.

06:27.100 --> 06:32.270
There's no need to hold back. Unless there's 
something in it that shouldn't be eaten.

06:33.990 --> 06:35.860
It's a parting gift from me.

06:36.350 --> 06:39.250
You won't be able to eat sweets in jail.

06:41.780 --> 06:44.230
We should give up, my brothers.

06:44.230 --> 06:45.510
What?!

06:45.510 --> 06:48.780
We've done enough, haven't we? 
All of these cruel things...

06:48.780 --> 06:50.760
Is money really that important?

06:50.760 --> 06:53.220
Meela, are you planning to betray us?

06:53.220 --> 06:55.570
You're the traitors here!

06:55.570 --> 06:57.970
You're the ones who betrayed 
the trust of the townspeople!

06:58.530 --> 07:00.780
Why should we care 
about stupid stuff like that?!

07:09.090 --> 07:12.290
Put your swords away. 
I don't want to fight you.

07:12.290 --> 07:13.280
No one asked you!

07:13.280 --> 07:14.090
Stand back!

07:24.180 --> 07:26.610
I don't have a defense skill.

07:26.610 --> 07:29.290
That's why I trained myself in defense.

07:29.710 --> 07:35.280
Tolto! My defense might even be 
stronger than your defense skill.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.050
Want to test it?

07:37.050 --> 07:38.980
You little—!

07:38.980 --> 07:42.310
Tolto, your longsword skill 
is a one-star, right?

07:42.310 --> 07:44.110
Mine is a two-star!

07:47.810 --> 07:48.820
You—!

07:53.990 --> 07:55.250
Mister Lattrua, behind you!

08:00.630 --> 08:01.790
What?

08:02.160 --> 08:04.410
Nullifying your flames 
makes this fight two-on-one.

08:04.410 --> 08:06.630
If both of us take you on, we won't lose!

08:09.530 --> 08:10.870
Mister Lattrua!

08:12.720 --> 08:14.430
Lastal! Leedel!

08:16.310 --> 08:17.770
What?

08:19.780 --> 08:21.060
Blast it!

08:29.940 --> 08:31.920
You're not hurt, are you, Ivy?

08:31.920 --> 08:33.620
N-No.

08:35.590 --> 08:37.080
Meela.

08:37.770 --> 08:38.980
It's all right.

08:39.330 --> 08:41.670
I can't do this anymore.

08:41.670 --> 08:43.070
I'm done.

08:44.550 --> 08:46.260
I'm sorry, Ivy.

08:46.690 --> 08:48.130
I've deceived you all this time.

08:48.130 --> 08:52.450
No. Thank you, Miss Meela.

08:52.450 --> 08:53.630
What?

08:55.930 --> 08:59.710
If you hadn't helped us, 
we'd have been...

08:59.710 --> 09:02.900
That's right. You saved us, Meela.

09:07.040 --> 09:09.240
Hey! What happened?

09:09.240 --> 09:11.400
Floflo's proprietor.

09:11.780 --> 09:15.300
Perfect timing. We're taking these two in.

09:15.300 --> 09:16.450
Can you help us?

09:17.000 --> 09:19.500
What's really going on here?

09:19.500 --> 09:22.550
We're acting as decoys in 
a strike against the organization.

09:22.550 --> 09:23.330
What?

09:23.630 --> 09:27.980
Right about now, they should be 
starting on the main part of the plan.

10:04.830 --> 10:05.580
This way.

10:12.450 --> 10:16.870
I never imagined that the organization 
had men inside the Watch, too.

10:17.400 --> 10:19.860
There's a hidden room 
in the library on the third floor.

10:20.800 --> 10:21.940
Understood.

10:21.940 --> 10:24.030
Hey, escort the count in.

10:24.030 --> 10:24.930
Sir!

10:31.490 --> 10:33.540
This is bad. What do we do?

10:33.960 --> 10:36.030
We have to tell our allies.

10:36.030 --> 10:39.080
But we don't know who's on our side.

10:39.980 --> 10:43.210
Why is this happening when 
the captain's not around?!

10:52.690 --> 10:54.500
Good work, men.

10:57.520 --> 11:02.020
This hidden room holds money 
and documents for safekeeping.

11:02.340 --> 11:06.580
While this special unit, or whatever 
it is, is headed for the forest,

11:06.580 --> 11:08.690
remove everything the room holds.

11:21.760 --> 11:23.580
What is this?

11:34.690 --> 11:36.330
What is this?

11:36.850 --> 11:38.760
It's smoke from a sleep sphere!

11:39.090 --> 11:40.370
A sleep sphere?

11:40.370 --> 11:41.890
Don't breathe it in!

11:44.660 --> 11:45.750
Huh?

11:45.750 --> 11:47.850
What is all this?

11:51.820 --> 11:54.060
Count, this is a trap!

12:11.070 --> 12:13.630
Is this what they mean by 
"being taken by surprise"?

12:13.630 --> 12:18.840
It is. Though, the guys behind us 
are trying to take us by surprise, too.

12:18.840 --> 12:25.810
No, they're being taken unawares by the 
same person as us, a nine-year-old child.

12:28.260 --> 12:31.490
I feel bad for Captain Burksby.

12:32.010 --> 12:36.280
What are you saying? I know you 
don't mean that one little bit.

12:36.760 --> 12:40.350
I do mean it. I feel bad for us, too.

12:40.350 --> 12:42.740
I never expected such a swift turn of events.

12:42.740 --> 12:44.340
It's good, though, isn't it?

12:44.340 --> 12:47.330
The day to clear years of frustration 
and resentment has finally come.

12:47.330 --> 12:49.630
And it's all thanks to Ivy.

12:49.630 --> 12:54.290
That's right. We should thank
 that child and go wild here.

12:54.290 --> 12:54.960
Agreed.

12:55.500 --> 12:57.730
Things have taken an interesting turn.

12:57.730 --> 13:01.700
Enjoying it is fine, 
but we can't afford to fail.

13:01.700 --> 13:04.180
Do you think I'd misstep?

13:04.640 --> 13:05.510
Here.

13:05.930 --> 13:07.270
This is...

13:07.270 --> 13:10.390
It can't be. Did that child 
think of this, too?

13:10.800 --> 13:13.020
No. It was Shifale.

13:13.410 --> 13:15.470
That's a relief.

13:15.470 --> 13:19.740
I'd be shocked if the kid had 
thought of something this disturbing.

13:20.130 --> 13:23.990
But it suits the idiots 
behind us very well.

13:27.380 --> 13:30.600
The traitors are perfectly 
placed at the front.

13:31.050 --> 13:34.700
It seems they intend to take 
care of you and me first.

13:34.700 --> 13:37.430
Must be to avoid leaving witnesses.

13:37.430 --> 13:41.980
To achieve that, they'd need to take out 
the strongest ones, us, first.

13:43.480 --> 13:46.670
If we were suddenly attacked 
by this many men we counted as allies,

13:46.670 --> 13:49.250
not even we would be 
able to stand against them.

13:49.250 --> 13:52.610
No, we wouldn't. But that's not 
how this is going to go.

13:53.890 --> 13:58.600
I'm no Ivy, but I will still take the opportunity 
to use my enemy's plan against them.

14:01.330 --> 14:03.030
Aggrop, make ready.

14:03.030 --> 14:04.990
At the ready.

14:04.990 --> 14:06.200
Wait for it.

14:11.840 --> 14:13.370
All right! That's half of them!

14:13.920 --> 14:14.830
This stupid—

14:28.790 --> 14:29.660
They've started!

14:29.660 --> 14:30.750
Let's go!

14:54.710 --> 14:57.150
Wh-What are you going to do?

14:57.650 --> 15:00.260
I'm going to do this!

15:00.260 --> 15:02.630
Wh-What's going on?

15:03.090 --> 15:07.790
Oh, you're all right. 
These guys are traitors.

15:07.790 --> 15:08.660
Huh?

15:08.660 --> 15:11.890
Help us. Grab the guys 
I say to and detain them.

15:11.890 --> 15:14.890
Capture all the traitors!

15:14.890 --> 15:16.000
Sir!

15:17.490 --> 15:20.250
This item is meant 
to capture large monsters.

15:20.950 --> 15:24.240
It's imbued with potent magic 
that suppresses physical strength.

15:24.880 --> 15:26.110
You can't escape.

15:26.630 --> 15:30.040
C-Captain, what are you doing?

15:30.360 --> 15:34.760
We've thoroughly investigated 
all of you! Traitors!

15:35.120 --> 15:38.040
Please don't say those things. 
It isn't funny, Captain!

15:38.040 --> 15:40.670
Look at the men around you, Gabojula.

15:41.330 --> 15:43.380
They're all members 
of the organization, aren't they?

15:43.730 --> 15:48.020
To all the fools here who conspired with the 
organization! Let this teach you a lesson!

15:51.820 --> 15:54.020
C-Captain!

15:54.020 --> 15:57.330
Th-This is all a misunderstanding! Captain!

15:57.330 --> 15:59.900
I haven't done anything!

15:59.900 --> 16:02.130
Oh, sorry.

16:02.130 --> 16:04.930
It was difficult to aim for just the traitors.

16:04.930 --> 16:07.610
We're grateful for your 
assistance in their capture.

16:07.610 --> 16:10.620
You can't mean that!

16:16.340 --> 16:21.420
We were able to safely capture 
all the traitors within the Watch.

16:22.740 --> 16:26.810
The traitors among the adventurers, too. 
We got all of them.

16:26.810 --> 16:29.930
And this is all thanks to 
the plan Ivy came up with.

16:30.270 --> 16:32.170
This is a huge accomplishment, Ivy.

16:32.170 --> 16:34.350
No, I didn't really do anything.

16:34.350 --> 16:38.440
No, this town has been saved thanks to you.

16:38.910 --> 16:40.950
Thank you, Ivy.

16:41.570 --> 16:43.880
Unhand me! Insolent cur!

16:43.880 --> 16:47.320
Do you understand what you're doing?

16:47.590 --> 16:52.650
You've laid hands on a noble! Don't think 
you'll get away with it, you ignorant fools!

16:52.650 --> 16:56.830
You're the one who won't be getting 
away with it, Count Faltoria.

16:58.100 --> 16:59.490
Foronda.

16:59.490 --> 17:00.670
Why are you...

17:00.670 --> 17:05.320
The Guild Master saw through your 
scheme and informed me of it.

17:05.630 --> 17:10.530
Once we look through the papers concealed 
here, your evil deeds will come to light.

17:10.530 --> 17:11.630
Don't be ridiculous!

17:11.950 --> 17:14.350
I've already sent a messenger 
to the royal capital.

17:14.350 --> 17:16.480
They've been informed 
of the details in this case.

17:17.270 --> 17:19.060
I'm sure you'll be punished in due time.

17:19.510 --> 17:21.160
I suggest you humble yourself.

17:22.770 --> 17:24.980
Where are they?

17:24.980 --> 17:26.830
Where are the traitors?

17:26.830 --> 17:29.730
I'll kill 'em! Drag them out here!

17:29.730 --> 17:30.950
Burn them all!

17:30.950 --> 17:33.650
This is bad. 
They've lost control of themselves.

17:33.650 --> 17:35.830
There are so many of them. This isn't good!

17:36.130 --> 17:38.360
The way things are going, 
there's going to be a riot.

17:38.360 --> 17:40.650
Men, we're going to stop this here!

17:41.290 --> 17:44.440
Hey! Bring 'em out! Let me at them!

17:45.350 --> 17:47.790
Everyone! Quiet, please!

17:50.680 --> 17:54.590
For many years, Otolwa has been 
the victim of the organization.

17:54.590 --> 17:56.220
We have captured their conspirators.

17:59.320 --> 18:02.630
We have found many 
traitors within the Watch.

18:03.140 --> 18:05.100
And within the adventurers as well.

18:06.080 --> 18:07.980
For that, I deeply apologize.

18:07.980 --> 18:11.590
Who are the traitors? Bring 'em out here!

18:11.590 --> 18:16.450
I'm very sorry, but we can't yet 
announce who has been captured.

18:17.120 --> 18:20.740
This is because we haven't yet secured 
conclusive evidence of their crimes.

18:20.740 --> 18:23.070
So what? Who are they? Tell us!

18:21.050 --> 18:24.560
We don't believe any mistakes have been 
made, but until we can secure evidence,

18:24.560 --> 18:26.790
we ask that you please wait 
until we announce everything.

18:27.390 --> 18:30.440
And we want all of you 
to promise us something.

18:30.840 --> 18:34.630
Promise that you'll not lay a finger 
on those we've arrested!

18:34.630 --> 18:36.190
What do you mean?

18:36.190 --> 18:37.330
We'll kill 'em!

18:37.330 --> 18:39.260
Burn 'em alive!

18:39.260 --> 18:43.170
As you are all aware, 
the convicted will become slaves.

18:43.170 --> 18:43.850
Slaves?

18:45.730 --> 18:50.470
But I'm certain that very few of you 
know where these slaves are sent.

18:51.090 --> 18:52.640
I know where!

18:53.110 --> 18:57.270
I know just how harsh a place 
those who commit crimes are sent!

18:58.830 --> 19:02.970
What awaits them there is hard labor 
that surpasses anything you can imagine!

19:03.330 --> 19:05.640
They can't even choose to die.

19:05.970 --> 19:09.290
They will be forced to continue to work 
for the benefit of our world.

19:09.740 --> 19:13.460
Every single day will be more 
cruel than words can express.

19:13.820 --> 19:15.300
It will be hell itself!

19:16.210 --> 19:20.980
If you kill them here,
then their suffering will end here.

19:21.370 --> 19:23.100
Should they be allowed that?

19:23.580 --> 19:26.850
Should they be released 
from their suffering so easily?

19:27.420 --> 19:29.020
I will not allow it!

19:29.020 --> 19:33.280
That's why I swear that I will see 
all of them enslaved!

19:34.170 --> 19:36.060
So, please promise me!

19:36.460 --> 19:39.260
Please don't lay a finger on any of them!

19:39.910 --> 19:43.240
All right! We can do that!

19:44.320 --> 19:46.820
The captain is amazing.

19:48.000 --> 19:52.030
He did that to keep the townspeople 
from committing crimes, right?

19:52.030 --> 19:55.220
It's amazing that you 
understand so much, Ivy.

19:55.760 --> 19:58.150
If not for the captain's words,

19:58.150 --> 20:03.010
some of those people who couldn't control 
their anger might have attacked the prisoners.

20:03.010 --> 20:08.050
Yes. And if any of the prisoners 
were killed in the process,

20:08.050 --> 20:11.220
then the victims would become the criminals.

20:11.220 --> 20:13.190
That would be too tragic.

20:13.190 --> 20:17.110
That's why the captain shouldered 
all the responsibility himself,

20:17.490 --> 20:21.860
saying he'd make them pay for 
their crimes for the rest of their lives.

20:21.860 --> 20:23.670
He's amazing!

20:25.030 --> 20:26.720
What are you doing?

20:27.710 --> 20:30.740
I was just thinking 
that you're amazing, too, Ivy.

20:31.120 --> 20:33.060
You really do understand, don't you?

20:33.060 --> 20:35.240
The captain is the amazing one.

20:35.800 --> 20:38.210
I want to be like the captain one day!

20:38.210 --> 20:39.340
What?

20:39.340 --> 20:40.680
Ivy...

20:40.680 --> 20:43.400
It's far too early to give up 
on living your life.

20:43.400 --> 20:47.780
That's right, Ivy. Why would you 
want to be like the captain?

20:47.780 --> 20:49.850
You still have a bright future ahead of you.

20:49.850 --> 20:51.300
Honestly, you two.

20:53.220 --> 20:55.650
Don't give Ivy any weird ideas.

20:56.040 --> 20:57.500
Thank you for your hard work.

20:59.110 --> 21:03.310
Thank you, Ivy. None of this would 
have been possible without you.

21:04.250 --> 21:06.740
Now, it's time for the finishing touch.

21:07.220 --> 21:10.080
We have one last job for you, Ivy.

21:22.990 --> 21:25.900
We've called you all here 
for just one reason!

21:27.670 --> 21:32.310
We're gathering information on the members 
of the organization that we've arrested!

21:32.310 --> 21:35.040
We are asking for your help!

21:35.530 --> 21:40.590
Anyone who refuses to cooperate will be 
suspected of colluding with the organization,

21:40.590 --> 21:42.160
so keep that in mind!

21:42.160 --> 21:45.320
We're investigating all of these people?

21:45.320 --> 21:49.640
Yes. They're all the people who were 
in the vicinity of the organization's base.

21:50.040 --> 21:53.090
We're going to catch anyone 
who was keeping watch on the place!

21:53.090 --> 21:54.820
There are so many of them.

22:05.900 --> 22:08.210
All right. Let's get started.

22:11.090 --> 22:14.680
<i>You are not alone</i>

22:14.680 --> 22:18.240
<i>Open your eyes</i>

22:18.240 --> 22:20.030
<i>That’s the way</i>

22:20.030 --> 22:24.730
<i>You’ll be fine</i>

22:24.730 --> 22:28.810
<i>All of us are here now</i>

22:28.810 --> 22:34.630
<i>You’re something special</i>

22:34.630 --> 22:41.900
<i>Please just relax, and move forward</i>

22:42.890 --> 22:47.310
<i>Because you are here now</i>

22:47.310 --> 22:52.170
<i>The world is so beautiful</i>

22:52.170 --> 22:57.920
<i>This place is full of light</i>

22:57.920 --> 23:04.540
<i>You had countless nights of tears</i>

23:04.540 --> 23:11.930
<i>But you walked all the way here</i>

23:11.930 --> 23:18.250
<i>If it’s dark we’ll be your light</i>

23:18.250 --> 23:28.080
<i>You see the end of this road 
is crystal clear</i>
